        0004-smp-index-the-T8132-CPU_START-status-mask-by-cpu-id-.patch
        0005-kboot-hand-the-preloaded-AVE-encoder-firmware-over-o.patch
        0006-tests-host-test-of-the-AVE-encoder-firmware-hand-ove.patch
        0007-kboot-admit-T8132-boards-per-handoff-path-from-one-t.patch
        0008-sio-build-the-T8132-SIO-s-firmware-tables-in-the-pro.patch
        0009-tests-host-test-of-the-SIO-firmware-tables.patch
        0010-kboot-enable-a-handed-over-external-DCP-and-its-Type.patch
